Z||000012||Formula88||03-26-2001||12:21 AM||||Fuse links to the computer?  I'm not aware of any.  I checked all the fuses in the fuse block.  What am I missing?  Are there fusible links to the ECM?<P>Thanks in advance for any help, guys. (and gals!)||||reg||1
